    <string name="health_steps_title">Keep ReelGuard running</string>
    <string name="health_steps_xiaomi">Xiaomi/Redmi/POCO: Settings > Apps > Manage apps > ReelGuard > Autostart: on; Battery saver: No restrictions. In Recents, lock ReelGuard (pull down on its card).</string>
    <string name="health_steps_samsung">Samsung: Settings > Battery > Background usage limits > Never sleeping apps: add ReelGuard. Also remove it from Sleeping and Deep sleeping apps.</string>
    <string name="health_steps_oneplus">OnePlus/Oppo/Realme: Settings > Battery > Battery optimization > ReelGuard > Don\'t optimize. Then Settings > Apps > ReelGuard > Allow auto-launch / background activity.</string>
    <string name="health_steps_generic">Allow ReelGuard to run unrestricted in the background: open battery optimization settings and set ReelGuard to Don\'t optimize, and enable autostart or background activity if your phone has that option. If the service gets turned off, re-enable it in Accessibility settings.</string>

